WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.768
Welcome.

2
00:00:04.118 --> 00:00:07.378
In this short video, we look at what diversity, equity and

3
00:00:07.378 --> 00:00:10.582
inclusion, or DEI, mean in research, and why they matter.

4
00:00:11.332 --> 00:00:14.041
DEI in research is about more than fairness.

5
00:00:14.391 --> 00:00:19.391
It means that all individuals, whatever their background, have equal opportunities

6
00:00:19.391 --> 00:00:23.415
to take part in research and to benefit from scientific discovery.

7
00:00:24.165 --> 00:00:29.176
By embracing DEI, researchers build a more representative and robust body of

8
00:00:29.176 --> 00:00:34.384
knowledge, one that addresses the needs and experiences of diverse communities.

9
00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:39.246
And because diverse teams bring a range of perspectives, skills

10
00:00:39.246 --> 00:00:44.990
and experiences, they enhance creativity, improve problem-solving and foster innovation.

11
00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:50.369
So DEI is both an ethical responsibility and a scientific necessity.

12
00:00:51.119 --> 00:00:52.741
Let's define the three terms.

13
00:00:53.091 --> 00:00:58.601
Diversity is the presence of a wide range of characteristics and experiences,

14
00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:05.613
such as race, gender, age, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability and socioeconomic background.

15
00:01:06.363 --> 00:01:10.310
Equity means fair access to opportunities, resources and support.

16
00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:14.062
It recognises that some people need additional assistance

17
00:01:14.062 --> 00:01:16.271
to reach the same outcomes as others.

18
00:01:17.021 --> 00:01:22.547
Inclusion is about creating environments where everyone feels respected, valued and able

19
00:01:22.547 --> 00:01:27.069
to contribute fully, so that every team member and participant is heard.

20
00:01:27.819 --> 00:01:30.881
In short: diversity is who is present, equity is

21
00:01:30.881 --> 00:01:34.517
fair access, and inclusion is whether every voice counts.

22
00:01:34.867 --> 00:01:40.073
Together, they make research more meaningful, credible and aligned with societal values.

